# The two shops either side of Market Square: the grocer, who sells bread,
# and the weaponsmith, who sells swords. `list`, `value`, `buy` and `sell`
# are the four commands shop_keeper intercepts, and each of them has a
# refusal worth as much as its success.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
goto 3010
look
set Parityone gold 5000
list
value bread
buy bread
inventory
sell bread
buy 3 bread
inventory
# Things the keeper does not have, and things it will not buy.
buy nothing
sell nothing
value nothing
load obj 3021
sell sword
goto 3011
list
value sword
buy sword
equipment
sell 2.sword
inventory
quit
